claim.claim-text:
a receiver unit (130) configured to receive data representing a second high-definition map (132);
a processor unit (110) configured for obtaining sensor data (122) representing an environmental condition in a periphery (304) of a device, the sensor data (122) comprising information about a size, a speed and/or a position of an object in the periphery (304); and configured to fuse the second high-definition map (132) and the sensor data (122) so as to provide a first high-definition map (470);
a transmitter unit (140) configured for transmitting a result of fusing (112) the second high-definition map (132) and the sensor data (122).

wherein the sensor data (122) is obtained by a scan of the periphery (304) of the device using a LiDAR sensor, wherein the environmental condition is a distance to detected objects within the periphery (304);
wherein the second high-definition map (132) is a map received from a further apparatus, the second high-definition map (132) comprising information relating to objects in an area of the second high-definition map (132) generated by the further apparatus; and
wherein the processor unit (110) is configured to adapt the information relating to the objects using the distance between the apparatus and the objects using the sensor data (122) and using an actual position of the apparatus.

providing a first high-definition map (470);
providing sensor data (122) with a sensor unit (120), the sensor data representing an environmental condition in a periphery (304) of an apparatus, the sensor data (122) comprising information about a size, a speed and/or a position of an object in the periphery (304);
receiving data representing a second high-definition map (132);
fusing the second high-definition map (132) and the sensor data (122) so as to provide the first high-definition map (470);
transmitting a result of fusing (112) the second high-definition map (132) and the sensor data (122).
